---
---

<section class="py-20 px-6 sm:px-12 md:px-16 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0A0E27] to-[#0A0E27]/80">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4 text-balance">
        Calculer votre ROI potentiel
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300">
        Découvrez les économies et gains que vous pourriez réaliser.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Capital substitution example -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Substitution Capital</h3>

        <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 p-6 bg-[#CEEF2C]/5 border border-[#CEEF2C]/20 rounded">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-slate-300">Salaire mensuel par poste</span>
            <span class="text-white font-semibold">2600€</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-slate-300">Nombre de postes remplacés</span>
            <span class="text-white font-semibold">3</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-slate-300">Durée d'amortissement</span>
            <span class="text-white font-semibold">6 mois</span>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-slate-600 pt-4">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-[#D8F847] font-bold">Économies annuelles</span>
              <span class="text-[#CEEF2C] font-bold text-lg">93600€</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">
          Calcul: 2600€ × 3 postes × 12 mois = <span class="text-[#CEEF2C] font-semibold">93600€/an</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick project example -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-700 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Projet Rapide</h3>

        <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 p-6 bg-[#CEEF2C]/5 border border-[#CEEF2C]/20 rounded">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-slate-300">Investment Actif</span>
            <span class="text-white font-semibold">5000€</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-slate-300">Timeline</span>
            <span class="text-white font-semibold">1 mois</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
            <span class="text-slate-300">Exemple: nouveaux leads générés</span>
            <span class="text-white font-semibold">+30/mois</span>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t border-slate-600 pt-4">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
              <span class="text-[#D8F847] font-bold">Breakeven (à 500€/conversion)</span>
              <span class="text-[#CEEF2C] font-bold text-lg">~11 leads</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">
          ROI en 1 mois si conversions &gt; 10 clients
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#CEEF2C]/10 to-[#D8F847]/10 border border-[#CEEF2C]/30 rounded-lg">
      <p class="text-center text-slate-200">
        Ces chiffres sont basés sur des cas réels. Votre ROI exact dépend de votre contexte.
        <span class="block text-[#CEEF2C] font-semibold mt-2">Parlons de votre cas d'usage spécifique.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
